## shadcn/ui

The following files are copied from shadcn/ui
(https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui, https://ui.shadcn.com), style `base-nova`,
via the shadcn CLI at shadcn@4.22.1:

- `web/src/components/ui/button.tsx`
- `web/src/components/ui/card.tsx`
- `web/src/components/ui/badge.tsx`
- `web/src/index.css` — the block marked `ejected from shadcn@4.22.1` is
  `shadcn/tailwind.css`, inlined by `shadcn eject`. The theme tokens after
  that block were generated by `shadcn init` for the Nova preset. The font
  stack and the system `prefers-color-scheme` rule were adapted here.

